Comment: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:09.98,OP,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:36.33,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Every day's unique, you get one chance at it
Comment: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:38.39,OP,,0,0,0,kara,So you'd better make it count
Comment: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:41.32,OP,,0,0,0,kara,When people flaunt morality
Comment: 0,0:02:41.56,0:02:45.03,OP,,0,0,0,kara,You've gotta beware they've got their own agenda
Comment: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:47.97,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Somewhere in your head, there's a voice that's messin' with ya
Comment: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:49.97,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Don't ever let it turn you 'round
Comment: 0,0:02:50.22,0:02:53.66,OP,,0,0,0,kara,It can't even blow all that hot air it's full of
Comment: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:56.60,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Get yourself in gear and live however you wanna
Comment: 0,0:02:56.74,0:03:01.64,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Live so fast that the claws of despair will languish in your dust
Comment: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:05.66,OP,,0,0,0,kara,And you'll be the one with an agenda that they'll all see as just
Comment: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:10.48,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,Keep on shouldering the world around you
Comment: 0,0:03:10.49,0:03:13.22,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,Keep on doubting every thought that's bound you
Comment: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:15.15,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,If things go awry, keep pushing through
Comment: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:18.00,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,And know that everything'll work in the end
Comment: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:22.04,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,If you find it's in your power to change the world
Comment: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:24.72,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,I'm sure you can make the future bright
Comment: 0,0:03:24.96,0:03:28.90,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,We'll blaze on ahead until we track down the route we want to take
Comment: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:34.57,OP,,0,0,0,kara,We'll keep trying every door until we find one that goes our way
Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.17,0:00:02.98,Main,,0,0,0,,My apologies for the wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.41,0:00:09.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You even had a change of clothes for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.06,0:00:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you ever so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.04,0:00:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you made your decision?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.58,0:00:14.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.82,0:00:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride, who was it that rescued me from the pub?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.75,0:00:21.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Val!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Come over here, right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.48,0:00:28.09,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Get off my back!\NYou don't need me for anything!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.94,0:00:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Mistress!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.47,0:00:34.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You shoulda told me when the pretty boy woke up!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.10,0:00:36.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.17,0:00:47.40,Main,,0,0,0,,'Cause this is what happens!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.21,0:00:53.66,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I gave him permission to ignore decorum,\Nbut only while he was keeping an eye on Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.05,0:00:59.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At any other time, he's bound\N to show deference by the fealty contract.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.32,0:01:01.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It was you?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.07,0:01:08.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You have my deepest gratitude\N for everything you've done.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.81,0:01:12.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what would have become of me without your help.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.61,0:01:16.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I will be sure to repay you for this kindness.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.73,0:01:20.95,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't choose to do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.95,0:01:23.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I was ordered to by my mistress!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.96,0:01:29.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mistress! Gimme a break already!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.04,0:01:31.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You have permission to ignore decorum with Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.95,0:01:38.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I only saved you 'cause my mistress ordered me to.\NCouldn't give a crap what happens to you!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.06,0:01:40.56,Main,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.55,0:01:46.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved me, and that fact is undeniable.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.50,0:01:48.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I truly am grateful to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.96,0:01:53.58,Main,,0,0,0,,And thank you to you two, as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.22,0:01:56.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to repay you in kind.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.87,0:02:03.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that's a genuine smile, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.88,0:02:08.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.10,0:03:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I do apologize for the sudden visit,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.62,0:03:46.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, King Gregorio.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.25,0:03:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Please excuse my intrusion.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.36,0:03:55.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I would like to explain the events leading up to this visit,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.24,0:03:59.73,Main,,0,0,0,,but before that, I have one request to make.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.39,0:04:06.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Would you please summon Prince Erwin\N and Prince Homer to join us right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.57,0:04:08.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I really would like to see them.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.77,0:04:10.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, as it happens...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.20,0:04:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure my sons would love to meet with Leon's fiancée.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.82,0:04:19.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my.\NDon't get the wrong idea, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.34,0:04:26.54,Main,,0,0,0,,As it currently stands, I am not here as Leon's fiancée,\Nbut as a representative of our queen.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.30,0:04:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,My mother has formally authorized me\N to act in this capacity.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.79,0:04:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I will ask you once more.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.03,0:04:44.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Please bring Prince Erwin and Prince Homer here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.72,0:04:46.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.93,0:04:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You're home safe!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.32,0:04:56.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It is an honor to meet the both of you,\NPrince Erwin and Prince Homer.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.80,0:05:03.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking excellent care of my darling fiancé.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.90,0:05:10.87,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.20,0:05:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Before we address the core of the matter,\NI know Leon has something to say about his situation.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.82,0:05:21.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.89,0:05:26.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Last night, I woke up sitting\N at a pub in town, unable to move,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.37,0:05:28.35,Main,,0,0,0,,before being rescued by Pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.61,0:05:33.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It was all part of a plot by Erwin and Homer to frame me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.67,0:05:37.98,Main,,0,0,0,,They came to my room and made me drink spiked wine,\Nthen abandoned me at the pub.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.38,0:05:43.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Leon!\NI think there's been a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.40,0:05:45.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Homer is right!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.56,0:05:51.41,Main,,0,0,0,,We only insisted on sharing some wine last night\Nbecause we were saddened to part ways with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.66,0:05:54.69,Main,,0,0,0,,But we'd never drug it! That's a wild accusation!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.69,0:05:56.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Except it's not.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.89,0:05:59.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride's subordinates rescued me from the pub.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.84,0:06:03.68,Main,,0,0,0,,They determined that I had been drugged.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.68,0:06:06.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, that proves nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.22,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all just rubbish cooked up by Princess Pride!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.22,0:06:12.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Freesia is trying to pull the wool over your eyes!{TLC: "that's just forcing freesia their narrative"}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.85,0:06:17.65,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right! Freesia has been\Nbuttering you up, Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.65,0:06:25.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that they're spouting this nonsense, I'd imagine\Nthey'll use it as an excuse to declare war on our nation!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.97,0:06:31.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, isn't it awfully {\i1}convenient{\i0}\Nthat they somehow found you just in the nick of time?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.59,0:06:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's painfully obvious.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.42,0:06:36.35,Main,,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Freesia has fabricated this entire farce,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.35,0:06:41.63,Main,,0,0,0,,either by hiring some mercenary kidnapper,\Nor even by convincing you to play along, Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.48,0:06:45.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Erwin, Homer...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.85,0:06:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd made myself clear!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.91,0:06:52.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I warned you to clean up your act before it was too late!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.19,0:07:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,My sons have done an intensely foolish thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.88,0:07:05.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I deeply apologize for their insolence.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.36,0:07:13.12,Main,,0,0,0,,In the name of King Gregorio of Anemone,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.38,0:07:15.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Erwin Adonis Coronaria...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.65,0:07:17.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Homer Adonis Coronaria...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.28,0:07:21.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I hereby strip you both\N of your royal titles and all rights therein!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.77,0:07:23.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Arrest them!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.86,0:07:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.76,0:07:28.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You ruffians!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.31,0:07:37.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Who besides me or Homer\N is fit to inherit the throne, Father?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.29,0:07:41.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.30,0:07:46.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I had a premonition.\NYou have something to discuss with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.31,0:07:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Or rather, originally you'd meant\N to discuss it with my mother, yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.50,0:08:01.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You wish to discuss the cancellation of my engagement with Prince Leon Adonis Coronaria.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.64,0:08:02.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.09,0:08:12.47,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to officially return\N Prince Leon's right to the throne.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you know that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.11,0:08:20.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Crown Princess Pride, at this time—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.89,0:08:22.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.20,0:08:27.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, listen to what I have to say first.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.77,0:08:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,As representative of the queen, acting on her behalf,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.07,0:08:43.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I am here to request the immediate dissolution\Nof my engagement to Prince Leon Adonis Coronaria.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.09,0:08:48.58,Main,,0,0,0,,For that is what the Kingdom of Freesia wishes.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.98,0:08:54.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.06,0:08:56.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Our brother is the perfect prince!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.66,0:09:00.14,Main,,0,0,0,,There is no reason for Freesia\N to want the engagement to be dissolved!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.14,0:09:01.90,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.90,0:09:03.52,Main,,0,0,0,,But there is a reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.04,0:09:09.23,Main,,0,0,0,,It's because the original purpose\N of our engagement no longer exists.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.81,0:09:17.82,Main,,0,0,0,,The engagement was first proposed as a way\N to solidify the alliance between our two kingdoms.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.00,0:09:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,And furthermore, to put that alliance\N on display for our neighboring countries.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.64,Main,,0,0,0,,But I had a premonition.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.14,0:09:33.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw the future of the Anemone Kingdom,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.15,0:09:37.53,Main,,0,0,0,,which had fallen to the verge of ruin\N after Prince Leon left.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.98,0:09:45.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon, your kingdom needs you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.09,0:09:55.90,Main,,0,0,0,,If you wish to become a ruler who loves and cherishes\N their citizens as I do, then we shall be sworn friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.30,0:09:59.04,Main,,0,0,0,,There is no need for an engagement.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.72,0:10:01.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Sworn friends...{I think the TL here misunderstood this to mean that their *kingdoms* would be sworn allies, but this is actually referring to Pride and Leon as individuals}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.06,0:10:02.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.53,0:10:08.70,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as our friendship holds firm,\Nthere could be no greater proof our lands' alliance.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.13,0:10:14.09,Main,,0,0,0,,The only thing we wish from the Anemone Kingdom
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.09,0:10:17.05,Main,,0,0,0,,is to retain the equal partnership that we've had until now!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.45,0:10:19.72,Main,,0,0,0,,And solidify it further!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.31,0:10:25.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Our alliance would never falter\N in the face of a mere cancelled engagement.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.48,0:10:28.86,Main,,0,0,0,,And as the Crown Princess, I will make sure of it...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.83,0:10:35.82,Main,,0,0,0,,with my sworn friend, Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.67,0:10:42.28,Main,,0,0,0,,And I too. Without fail.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.05,0:10:53.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll regret this, Leon! You're a joke!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.97,0:10:57.62,Main,,0,0,0,,A soulless puppet like you can never become king!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.62,0:11:01.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a dumb patsy who never realized\N what Homer and I were up to!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.32,0:11:03.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have what it takes to rule a kingdom!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.73,0:11:07.06,Main,,0,0,0,,This place will fall apart in no time with you in charge!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.13,0:11:12.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Then you'll look back and realize the truth!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.34,0:11:14.70,Main,,0,0,0,,That I was the one worthy of being king!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.19,0:11:20.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm obviously superior to a pathetic bastard like you\Nwho can't live without being loved by the masses!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.38,0:11:33.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Now you listen here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.58,0:11:37.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon has all the qualities needed to become a great king.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.24,0:11:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,He is not a puppet or anything of the sort.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.85,0:11:45.22,Main,,0,0,0,,He loves his people more than himself\N and strives to live up to their expectations.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.22,0:11:48.91,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a vital asset who has dedicated himself to being a worthy king.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.93,0:11:56.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You think this land will fall apart with him in charge?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.69,0:12:04.37,Main,,0,0,0,,In my premonition, that's exactly what happened\N after Prince Leon left and {\i1}you{\i0} became king.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.00,0:12:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Under your reign, the people fled the country\N to escape poverty, hampering your trade relations.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.78,0:12:14.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Even the royal family declined into such a state
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.66,0:12:19.42,Main,,0,0,0,,that one could hardly imagine that\N the Kingdom of Anemone had once prospered.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.26,0:12:21.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Elder Sister...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.49,0:12:31.40,Main,,0,0,0,,And worst of all, the instant things started looking bad,\Nyou came to Freesia begging for Prince Leon's help!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.78,0:12:36.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's how things play out for them in the game.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.29,0:12:42.94,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Despite being the source of Leon's downfall,\Nthey shamelessly come to him for help over and over.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.58,0:12:45.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They beg him to come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.75,0:12:46.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.42,0:12:53.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They have the gall to ask him:\N"Do you not care what happens to our people?!"
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.12,0:12:58.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This infuriates Leon, who sends them packing.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.54,0:13:04.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Afterwards, he breaks down in Tiara's arms\N in one of the game's most heartbreaking scenes.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.42,0:13:12.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ever since his brothers were young, they'd harbored\N a sense of inferiority towards Crown Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.40,0:13:15.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why they spread rumors about him,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.67,0:13:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}resulting in Leon being forced to marry\N into the Freesian royal family.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.07,0:13:23.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, the king later learns the truth...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.93,0:13:30.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and upon deciding that Leon should be\N the heir to the throne after all, he warns them:
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.73,0:13:34.51,Main,,0,0,0,,You best clean up your act before it's too late!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.51,0:13:36.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that doesn't stop them.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.38,0:13:43.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Determined to force Leon out of contention for the throne,\N they get him drunk and drop him off at a pub.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.48,0:13:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That alone makes them utter scumbags,\N but it gets worse...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.81,0:13:52.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You witch.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.80,0:13:55.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Just how much did your premonition show you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.65,0:13:57.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I know all sorts of things.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.92,0:14:03.07,Main,,0,0,0,,For example, the fact His Majesty\N already knew of your wrongdoings,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.72,0:14:10.49,Main,,0,0,0,,and told you he would make Leon\N heir to the throne a few days ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.15,0:14:14.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember this.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.76,0:14:19.09,Main,,0,0,0,,From here on,\Nno matter what punishment you face...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.16,0:14:27.90,Main,,0,0,0,,if you ever pose a threat to this kingdom or\N my sworn friend Prince Leon again, I will {\i1}not{\i0} stand for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.56,0:14:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,If you dare to cross that line, then you will be making\N a personal enemy of Pride Royal Ivy.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.92,0:14:41.93,Main,,0,0,0,,And I will carry out fitting retribution {\i1}myself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.37,0:14:47.43,Main,,0,0,0,,As if some lucky bitch born into\N a queendom is worth anything!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.12,0:14:54.21,Main,,0,0,0,,After all this, do you think {\i1}you're{\i0}\N worth enough to call yourselves royalty?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.85,0:15:01.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leon was racked by so much grief\N at the start of the game...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.29,0:15:08.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}because all of the Anemonians who'd been\N in the pub with him were sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.17,0:15:16.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even worse, Pride had ordered Leon to kill them himself.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.81,0:15:25.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To top it off, it was his brothers who offered the innocent citizens to Pride as "criminals" in the first place.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.47,0:15:35.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Soon after Leon moves to Freesia, the king falls ill\N and dies, causing his brothers to inherit the throne.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.39,0:15:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They proceed to make an absolute mess of everything
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.43,0:15:42.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and then have the gall to ask Leon to fix it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.70,0:15:50.14,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They pressure Tiara to help them\N convince him to return to Anemone,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.65,0:15:56.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and even kidnap Tiara to use as a hostage\N and threaten Leon into coming back home.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.58,0:16:03.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We all carry the duty of royalty,\Nso I can't find it in myself to cut them any slack right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.46,0:16:05.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.96,0:16:09.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What was it you hoped to do after taking the throne?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.22,0:16:15.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Because if your citizens weren't\N the first thing on your mind, then that says it all.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.04,0:16:21.98,Main,,0,0,0,,You have no right to deny someone\N with as noble a heart as Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.36,0:16:29.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I've overstepped my bounds.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.62,0:16:37.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Elder Sister, are you all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.78,0:16:40.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.12,0:16:42.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.74,0:16:57.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.41,0:17:07.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon, please be proud.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.72,0:17:10.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Please love. Please wish for things.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.43,0:17:16.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Your pure heart and this country that you love so much...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.41,0:17:18.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all so very beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.56,0:17:27.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's gone through so much suffering these past few days because of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.38,0:17:31.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Despite being tormented by the love of his country,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.37,0:17:34.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he kept it all bottled inside to maintain appearances.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.60,0:17:40.07,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He played the role of the sweet prince \Nand suppressed all his true feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.77,0:17:43.92,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All while smiling and whispering words of love to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.25,0:17:48.99,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But in reality, he was full of more\N pain and regret than anyone.{@ED bit weirdly phrased, i think? -p}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.61,0:17:51.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.26,0:17:56.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so glad I could give him back\N his precious Kingdom of Anemone.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.26,0:18:01.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And return him to his rightful place within it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.10,0:18:08.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Crown Prince Leon Adonis Coronaria.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.79,0:18:13.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you swear, in sickness and in health,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.49,0:18:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,for richer or for poorer,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.76,0:18:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,to love the people of your country,\N to adore and protect them,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.45,0:18:28.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and to dedicate yourself to improving their lives?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.46,0:18:32.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.42,0:18:40.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty King Gregorio,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I have one more thing to ask of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.31,0:18:48.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce my younger brother\Nand the knights who helped to make this right.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.82,0:18:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Please do them the honor of shaking\N their hands and greeting them.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.09,0:18:55.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I will do the same!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.25,0:19:16.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything should be okay now.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.67,0:19:21.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the game, the king had to make it known that Leon\N had been punished for the commotion at the pub
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.77,0:19:24.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and exiled him from the country.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.27,0:19:29.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But as soon as Leon was sent to Freesia, the king fell ill and passed away.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.08,0:19:35.53,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, Arthur's special ability\N is the power to heal anything in creation.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.26,0:19:38.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Based on the look he just gave,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.56,0:19:42.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure the king's sickness has already been cured.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.93,0:19:48.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess Pride...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.15,0:19:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You can keep calling me Pride\N like you have up to now, Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.57,0:19:56.47,Main,,0,0,0,,We are sworn friends, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.66,0:20:05.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, please call me Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.07,0:20:07.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd be happier that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.64,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.04,0:20:12.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I look forward to seeing you again.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.79,0:20:13.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.40,0:20:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.89,0:20:17.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.57,0:20:31.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.24,0:20:33.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.74,0:20:40.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.81,0:20:46.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I am forever in your debt.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.01,0:20:53.50,Main,,0,0,0,,If you or Freesia ever need anything,\N the Kingdom of Anemone will...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.55,0:20:58.28,Main,,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}I{\i0} will come running to your aid, no matter what.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.41,0:21:06.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Let us keep in touch.\NI will come see you as often as needed.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.97,0:21:11.46,Main,,0,0,0,,And I will be waiting for you\N here in my beloved country, always.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my darling fiancée.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.02,0:21:27.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You are my first love.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.52,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Princess Pride?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.85,0:21:35.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Elder Sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.65,0:21:39.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}F-F-First love?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.47,0:21:42.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pride? Me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.80,0:21:45.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, jeez!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.28,0:21:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the incredible seductiveness\N of the "flirt" archetype from the first ORL game for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.97,0:23:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:\NFrom Villainess to Savior.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.72,0:23:37.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Episode 5:\N"The Cruel Queen Takes Notice, and is Noticed".
